            "caption": "东1局1本场的弃和切牌顺序示例：西家手牌与四家牌河。",
            "imageSha256": "c10b9322a92221e3eec09cef41b00d90ee1cc7cbbdbe27efd0860c41a5257afb",
            "imageProvenance": {
